OL,4,BFerrari facing 'very challenging       
OL,5,Btimes' - Hamilton                      
OL,6,GLewis Hamilton says Ferrari are facing 
OL,7,G"very, very challenging times" as a    
OL,8,Gresult of the series of on-track       
OL,9,Gincidents between himself and team-    
OL,10,Gmate Charles Leclerc.                  
OL,12,FThe two drivers had talks on Thursday  
OL,13,Fafter arriving at the Qatar Grand Prix 
OL,14,Fto discuss the fall-out from their     
OL,15,Fcollision in the race in Las Vegas     
OL,16,Flast weekend, which team boss Frederic 
OL,17,FVasseur said was "completely           
OL,18,Funacceptable".                         
OL,20,FBoth said the conclusion of those      
OL,21,Fdiscussions would "stay internal" but  
OL,22,Fadmitted a solution needed to be found.
